cannot establish a dominant settling cause, so any coordinate improvement is a measured association, not an attributed mechanism.","search.family_coordinate@1.0.0 supplies candidate ask/tell only; each coordinate still requires validated candidate preparation plus fresh simulation.run, evaluation.run, control.profile_report and a frozen bound comparison, and this stage executes no batch and promotes no candidate.","Raw scalar objectives under different weights are not ranked (F141, F286); local or raw weighted cost values cannot serve as the final physical ranking, which is joint acceptance first and otherwise componentwise physical comparison of terminal_error_m, holding_max_error_m and holding_max_speed_m_s (F363).","Sampled holding evidence covers only the final 0.05 s (6 samples, F101, F71) with no continuous-time guarantee (F185, F331); the holding metrics are sampled maxima, not continuous-time certification.","effective_horizon, optimization_raw_status and optimization_selected_iteration (F640, F681, F662, F690, F635) are controller-side plan records, not backend motion, and are not causal evidence; the performed check read only 8 of 35 update records, so the other 27 remain not_read.","Frames are kept distinct: world for tip vectors, projected GVS coordinates for state, serial backend joint coordinates for q/qdot; applied updates (35) are distinct from optimized noninitialization selections (6).","Full historical warm plans and optimizer iteration traces are not retained (control_snapshots.json absent); provider transport failures may be retried a bounded number of times (stated in planned_budget.model_calls) and are not scientific evidence."],"fixed_conditions":["robot","task","acceptance","controller_implementation","other_numerical_settings"],"fixed_controller":"controller.gvs_nmpc@7.0.0","hypothesis":"On the frozen baseline, joint_reach_holding_acceptance fails (F402) only in the holding window while terminal reach passes (F47, F62 inside the 0.01 m tolerance F456); raising the two granted tip-speed weight coordinates — holding_tip_speed_weight upward from its saved 0.05 and terminal_tip_speed_weight upward from its saved 0.0 — can reduce the sampled final-window holding max tip speed (F160 = 1.1750052670100422 m/s vs limit F440 = 0.02 m/s) and holding max position error (F32 = 0.05650455971948983 m vs limit F456 = 0.01 m) toward the settling limits without losing the terminal-reach margin, if the effect of the already-applied 0.0->0.05 holding change (delta speed F301 = -0.4060100069642385 m/s against baseline F58) continues monotonically and is not dominated by the persistent compute-budget/horizon truncation observed in the plan records (F90/F29 deadline_misses 35 of 35 at F274/F76 = 0.01 s control period; F640 = 7, F691 = 5, F711 = 3, F681 = 1 effective_horizon over the final window).","max_candidates":6,"method":"search.family_coordinate@1.0.0","objectives":["joint_reach_holding_acceptance","terminal_error_m","holding_max_error_m","holding_max_speed_m_s","complete_update_s"],"planned_budget":{"backend_solves":6,"model_calls":8,"tool_calls":24,"wall_s":5940.0,"worker_calls":0},"rationale":"Authored from the accepted revision artifact f4499792c577e668e648ed0bba2435d312f5a83dc774dbd4e329d2f3482fcc4d and the performed check result artifact 0013c7bdcac007c4071228871541b353a1fbf05cb766cacb4be709b6061e9056 (aliases F628-F723), which together record the only executed change as control/recipe/holding_tip_speed_weight 0.0 -> 0.05 with terminal_tip_speed_weight left at 0.0 (F462, F538, F454). That change is a sealed physical_tradeoff (F199): sampled holding improved but still fails (holding_max_speed_m_s 1.1750052670100422 against 0.02 m/s, F160/F440; holding_max_error_m 0.05650455971948983 against 0.01 m, F32/F456; holding_position_passed false F12, holding_speed_passed false F25), while terminal reach worsened but still passes (candidate 0.00869890424761182 m F62, delta +0.001056295661744434 m F97, terminal_reach_passe